# Local-only docs (per-cycle working artifacts: design, scope, defer-lists,
# recon, phase-b operator runbooks). Single rule: anything under
# docs/internal/ is local-only. To make a doc local-only, place it under
# docs/internal/ — the file's name no longer matters.
docs/internal
phase-b/data-*/
phase-b/*.sh
